  "prompt": "If $f(x)=\\frac{g(x)}{x}$ where $g(2)=4$ and $g'(2)=8$, compute $f'(2)$.",
  "image": null,
  "choices": null,
  "answer": "3",
  "acceptedAnswers": null,
  "answerUnit": null,
  "solutions": [
   {
    "title": "Quotient rule",
    "body": "$f'(x)=\\frac{g'(x)x-g(x)}{x^2}$, so $f'(2)=\\frac{8\\cdot2-4}{4}=3$.\n\n**Answer: 3**"
   }
